# pdf-worker イメージ用（BuildKit は Dockerfile と同名の .dockerignore を優先する）。許可リスト方式
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/shared-types/package.json
!packages/shared-types/LICENSE
!packages/shared-types/src/
!apps/pdf-worker/package.json
!apps/pdf-worker/LICENSE
!apps/pdf-worker/src/

# テストはイメージに入れない
**/*.test.ts
apps/pdf-worker/src/testing/
